# 0215 = 0214 (plan stage 1, length passthrough): GPD dw3 goes from
#   frames*512 fixed to actual bytes this GPD (hdr+n each), plus BIT(29)
#   ZLP tail marker on 512-multiples (vendor GPD_EXT_FLAG_ZLP old-IP path).
#   QCR1 TX_ZLP (0x2) already on. Single variable; TQCPR/next-HWO/fast
#   path and supply timing untouched.
